<title>USA: Titan hires adviser to weigh possible sale.</title>
<headline>Titan hires adviser to weigh possible sale.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Titan Holdings Inc said on Tuesday that it had retained an adviser to help evaluate a potential sale of some or all of its business.</p>
<p>Specifically, Titan said it had received &quot;expressions of interest&quot; regarding a possible sale, and so had hired Furman Selz LLC to examine the situation. Titan did not identify the interested party.</p>
<p>Titan Holdings Inc operates specialty property and casualty insurance companies and related services companies.</p>
</text>
